false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrmee60505d9bivcmy92uddy","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T02:48:46.760Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1v63wu5","name":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T02:48:46.760Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Anthropic 新研究：2026 年夏季的智能体行为偏差。 在我们的敲诈实验一年后，我们又发现了四种当今自主 AI 智能体在模拟中行为不当的方式。 了解更多：https://alignment.anthropic.com/2026/agentic-misalignment-summer-2026/","reportEdition":"2026-07-16","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrmi4f4x01ilbiul55xb25fm","title":"OpenAI 用 AI 攻击自家 AI：GPT-Red 自动发现安全漏洞，成功率 84% 远超人类","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-07-16T00:00:06.372Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrmi4f4x01ilbiul55xb25fm","https://the-decoder.com/openai-is-now-using-ai-to-attack-its-own-ai-and-its-working-better-than-humans-ever-did"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrmi4f4x01ilbiul55xb25fm","title":"OpenAI 用 AI 攻击自家 AI：GPT-Red 自动发现安全漏洞，成功率 84% 远超人类","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 训练了内部 AI 模型 GPT-Red，通过自我对弈强化学习自动模拟提示词注入等攻击，在测试场景中成功率达 84%，而人类红队仅为 13%。GPT-Red 的发现直接用于训练，使 GPT-5.6 Sol 在直接提示词注入上的故障次数比四个月前的最佳模型减少六倍，且未影响通用性能。约 3.8% 的“更强”提示词注入仍能成功，GPT-Red 暂不对外开放。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrmi4f4x01ilbiul55xb25fm","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-is-now-using-ai-to-attack-its-own-ai-and-its-working-better-than-humans-ever-did","publishedAt":"2026-07-16T00:00:06.372Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","famil