xcf8","originalSourceName":"Meta Engineering Blog（RSS）","family":"outlet-mw76rg","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrmctfys042wbivcjf3z4dad","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T02:48:46.760Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1crxcf8","name":"Meta Engineering Blog（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T02:48:46.760Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Meta 提出分层兴趣表示，一种基于 Transformer 图学习与自监督跨视图蒸馏的上游表示层，为广告实体学习统一嵌入。该系统在数十亿真实交互数据上端到端训练，输出通用嵌入和 Bag-of-Meaning 兴趣 token，旨在连接稀疏的深度漏斗信号与广告主供给。该技术可集成至 Meta 的生成式广告模型（GEM）、Andromeda 及自适应排序模型。","reportEdition":"2026-07-16","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrmjf91q034ibiuliv4avu1p","title":"Apple 提出 CLaRa：用连续潜在推理桥接检索与生成","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-07-16T00:00:06.372Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmrmjf91q034ibiuliv4avu1p","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/clara-latent-reasoning"],"articles":[{"id":"cmrmjf91q034ibiuliv4avu1p","title":"Apple 提出 CLaRa：用连续潜在推理桥接检索与生成","originalTitle":"","summary":"Apple 机器学习研究团队提出 CLaRa，一种通过连续潜在推理桥接检索与生成的新方法。该方法在检索增强生成（RAG）中引入连续潜在空间，使模型在生成答案前先进行隐式推理，从而缓解长上下文带来的性能下降。CLaRa 在多个知识密集型基准上提升了 LLM 的准确率与效率。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmrmjf91q034ibiuliv4avu1p","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/clara-latent-reasoning","publishedAt":"2026-07-16T00:00:06.372Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learni